  <page_number>28</page_number>
  <running_head>De Episcopatu / §. III.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>homines</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">mine, quòd quasdam actiones pasto-</l>
    <l n="2">rum formaliter exercent, circa alias</l>
    <l n="3">autem objectivè tantùm se habent.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Formaliter quoad doctrinam verbi</l>
    <l n="5">divini &amp; veram Religionem, quam</l>
    <l n="6">utriq; tenentur docere &amp; tueri</l>
    <l n="7">con-tra Hæreticos &amp; alios errantes; item</l>
    <l n="8">consequenter quoad judicium feren-</l>
    <l n="9">dum de rebus fidei, tùm extra Syno-</l>
    <l n="10">dum, tùm in Synodis. Objectivè</l>
    <l n="11">autem quoad specialem doctrinam</l>
    <l n="12">de officio pastorum. Nam quamvis</l>
    <l n="13">ipsi, (si ad officium Pastorum vocati</l>
    <l n="14">non sint) haud habeant potestatem</l>
    <l n="15">concionandi, Sacramenta adminis-</l>
    <l n="16">trandi, disciplinam Ecclesiasticam</l>
    <l n="17">exercendi, pastores vocandi, Leges</l>
    <l n="18">ferendi Ecclesiasticas, tamen docent</l>
    <l n="19">ex verbo Dei, quam doctrinam po-</l>
    <l n="20">pulo annunciare debeant veri pasto-</l>
    <l n="21">res, quomodo Sacramenta admini-</l>
    <l n="22">strare, disciplinam Ecclesiasticam</l>
    <l n="23">exercere, in externo ordine Ecclesiæ</l>
    <l n="24">se gerere debeant tàm erga Magistra-</l>
    <l n="25">tum, quàm erga se ipsos[?] &amp; quosvis homines</l>
  </main_text>
</page>
